","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[6,5,1,7.62],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[34,33,1,43.15],"pricing_power":[2,0,2,2.54],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[3,3,0,3.81,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":2,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0649,"r5":0.1406,"r20":0.2589,"r1_spy":0.0629,"r5_spy":0.1226,"r20_spy":0.2515,"r1_sector":0.0584,"r5_sector":0.1057,"r20_sector":0.2655,"etf":"XLY"}},{"id":"WSM 2026 Q2","t":"WSM","d":"2026-08-26","time":"bmo","w":9340,"n":38,"url":"","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[1,1,0,1.08],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[7,7,0,7.59],"ai_spend":[1,1,0,1.08],"tariffs":[36,9,27,39.05],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[7,3,4,7.59,{"raise":7,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0115,"r5":-0.0538,"r20":-0.0294,"r1_spy":0.0112,"r5_spy":-0.0484,"r20_spy":-0.0319,"r1_sector":0.0182,"r5_sector":-0.0253,"r20_sector":0.0325,"etf":"XLY"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"WSM 2020 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2020-05-28","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Jonathan Matuszewski","x":"You mentioned robust new customer growth in the DTC channel.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2020 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2020-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"We did not quantify the actual pure merch margin, but we did indicate that it was higher than last year, which helped with offsetting some of the higher shipping costs and the incremental impact from the China tariffs that we had within the quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2020 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2020-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"But on the flip side, you still have the China tariffs, which I know is not the topic de jure, but it's still a significant amount that we absorbed in Q1.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2020 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2020-08-26","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Chukumba","x":"And historically, you've been sort of like 50-50 between in-store revenues, DTC.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2020 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2020-08-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"So from a China tariff perspective, as we've said before, as we move throughout the year, the year-over-year impact becomes less.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2020 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2020-08-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"And so that will reduce as we move throughout the year, but we'll still have, obviously, the China tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Horvers","x":"How much of that was perhaps the shipping volume surcharges fading, how much of that was perhaps taking some price increases on existing inventory as raw material costs have accelerated and some of the shipping costs have accelerated.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"The pricing power and our merchandise margins due to our differentiated product positioning with design-led, value-engineered and sustainable products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"And the reason we can do that is because of our pricing power because of what we sell that it's in-house design, it's proprietary and it's designed for value, engineered for value.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2021-11-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Whalen","x":"You watched us cover the really difficult tariff that people couldn't believe we could cover.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2021-11-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hannah Pittock","x":"My first question, within selling margins, if we think about the year-over-year expansion, can you give us some qualitative color on how much of that was lower promotions, taking price, and to the extent that there was an offset there in higher product costs?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2021-11-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hannah Pittock","x":"Any issues raising prices within specific banners?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2021-11-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"As a result, we are raising our full year outlook to reflect revenue growth of 22% to 23% and operating margins of 16.9% to 17.1%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2022-03-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And so we -- not only did we stop site-wide promotions, but we've strategically taken price increases carefully where we could.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2021 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2022-03-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Our pricing power is a measure of our merchandise and product initiatives internally and the strength of our brands.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2022-05-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charles Grom","x":"And just a quick follow-up would be you've had great success raising prices over the past 12 to 24 months.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2022-08-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And in Rejuvenation consumer and B2B business are both performing consistent to each other and seeing strong performance across DTC and retail and Rejuvenation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2022-08-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And at this point, we are sort of plateauing on raising our prices.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2022-08-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And it is this continued outperformance that gives us the confidence to reiterate our 2022 guidance and longer-term outlook today.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2022-11-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"In some cases, it's going to be important to pass along part of that to the consumer because everybody had to take a price increase.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2022-11-17","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Bradley Thomas","x":"The first just thinking about sales for the fourth quarter, I know you reiterated the full year guidance, but technically, if we back into what's implied, it's a pretty wide range.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2022 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2023-03-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Oliver Wintermantel","x":"And as a follow-up, you've done a really good job in the cost-cutting areas.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2023-05-23","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Chukumba","x":"So you've talked in the past about the fact that as access to easy money has dried up a lot of these smaller DTC brands, these ankle biters, I believe is the term that you've used, you're seeing more like inbounds where they're trying to sell to you or maybe they're going away.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2023-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"And Anna, in respect to your question on the $40 million in savings, our cost-cutting measures happened in phases across the quarter, both domestically and internationally.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2023-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Anna Andreeva","x":"And then secondly, on the $40 million in cost reduction I think you said some of it affected the P&L already in the first quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2023-05-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Maksim Rakhlenko","x":"So first, just staying on the reiterated guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2023-11-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We took some price increases during the pandemic, as you know.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2024-03-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Katharine McShane","x":"And I just wanted to ask a follow-up question with regards to tariffs that if there were to be, [ I noticed ] is a risk profile for your guidance, the election.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2024-03-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Katharine McShane","x":"But how are you thinking about managing through a scenario where there could be more tariffs?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2023 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2024-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Horvers","x":"But could you maybe help us think about like on the SG&A line, you've done an incredible job, really managing around incentives and the advertising, flexing it with demand and you had some headcount reductions as well a year ago.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"And of that 25%, a third of them already have a Trump tariff on them, which we've been paying and are still on them.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"The fact that, if this does come up and tariffs are expanded, we're prepared to reduce it further.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Third, the pricing power of our in house designed proprietary products and our emphasis on full price selling contributing to a 380 basis point improvement in merchandise margins.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"This is yielding improved customer service, reduced customer lead times, and significant cost savings for more efficient operations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Moreover, we are seeing cost savings across the supply chain for more consistent operations, including warehouse, manufacturing and delivery expenses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2024-08-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We are now expecting full year revenues to come in at range of down 4% to down 1.5%, but we are raising our guidance on operating margin to be in the range of 17.4% to 17.8%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"In terms of China tariffs and our outlook on that, first, there's a lot of uncertainty in terms of what's happening there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Third, we're prepared to reduce our exports to China further if tariffs increase.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And I think we're really balancing that well, and it's going to be a key part of staying ahead and giving us pricing power to continually design our own products and bring them to market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"A big part of the improvement since 2019 has been our pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Fourth, our ongoing opportunity to achieve cost savings from supply chain efficiency, producing a 100 basis point improvement to last year in selling margin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"We continue to realize cost savings across the supply chain, driven by more consistent operations from less promotional excellence.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"As a result, we are raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q3","e":"wsm","d":"2024-11-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We now expect full year revenues to come in at a range of down 3% to down 1.5% and we are raising our guidance on operating margin 40 basis points to be in the range of 17.8% to 18.2%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2025-03-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Included in our year-end inventory levels is a strategic pull forward China receipts to reduce the potential impact of higher tariffs in fiscal year '25.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2025-03-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Regarding tariffs, our operating margin guidance includes the tariff increases implemented as of this call.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2025-03-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"As Laura mentioned, we are passing on targeted price increases to our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2024 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2025-03-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Laura Alber","x":"…getting some relief from our great vendor partners and moving things to areas that are -- that don't have tariffs or we expect to be less tariffed, we have taken some targeted price increases on items that are either underpriced or that we're overselling, and we're seeing good results from that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"As we said last quarter, our guidance incorporates our current initiatives and the existing tariff environment, which includes the tariffs that we discussed in March and now the additional China tariff at 30% and the global reciprocal tariff at 10%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"It does not assume any other tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Fifth, we are expanding our made-in-the-USA assortment production and partnerships, and lastly, we are carefully taking select price increases on products to offer strong value with a focus on maintaining competitive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We've taken some very carefully selected price increases on those things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"That includes reducing split shipments, lowering returns and damages, and streamlining our fulfillment processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We believe the six-point plan will allow us to absorb the additional tariffs since we last spoke and yet still reiterate our annual guidance today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2025-05-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"As a result, we are reiterating our guidance for fiscal year 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/22/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"In Canada, both retail and DTC channels are outperforming, supported by differentiated product offerings and enhanced omnichannel strategy and the expansion of our B2B program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"I talked about West Elm, which is really hitting it out of the park with this fall assortment, and a lot more newness on the floor and at DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sameer Hassan","x":"So Laura mentioned earlier the results that we're seeing from our investment in AI, which are really exciting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sameer Hassan","x":"I think one thing that I'd love to highlight that's important to understand is how we're delivering those results when it's been pretty well publicized that most companies aren't seeing that type of ROI with their AI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"In terms of how that incremental revenue flows through to our operating margin, we expect that this additional top-line growth will be pressured by incremental tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Since we last gave guidance, the tariff environment has evolved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Lastly, we are carefully taking select price increases on products with a focus on maintaining competitive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"Select price increases and higher full-price selling drove this improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"results from these investments, from higher conversion and sales growth to measurable cost savings and productivity gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q2","e":"wsm","d":"2025-08-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"We believe the strength of our operating model combined with the six-point mitigation plan that Laura shared with you enables us to maintain our guidance despite the doubling of tariffs since our last earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/27/williams-sonoma-wsm-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Finally, our DTC channel was strong due to an improved customer experience, continued personalization, and incredible service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We will continue to improve how customers discover and shop our brands, and we will build on the momentum we have seen in both DTC and retail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We will stay disciplined in controlling variable costs including employment and ad spend, and we will drive AI-enabled efficiencies, including savings in engineering costs, care center payroll, and creative costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"We delivered these results despite no material changes in the macro environment and continued unpredictability around logistics and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"Normalizing for the 53rd week last year and the tariff impact this year, we delivered substantial operating margin improvements versus last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Howie","x":"…and business-to-business; our relentless focus on customer service, which drives efficiency and cost savings across our supply chain; and finally, a proven operating model that consistently delivers highly profitable earnings. Now let us turn to the numbers and see how our competitive…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2025 Q4","e":"wsm","d":"2026-03-18","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Alber","x":"And in fact, we raised our guidance twice during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/williams-sonoma-wsm-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"We also saw strength in both our retail and DTC channels, with improvements across the customer journey.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"At the Pottery Barn channel level, DTC improved as we focused on the digital experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"We delivered this operating margin even while absorbing tariffs and higher fuel costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"Which includes, but is certainly not limited to, war, trade policy, including tariffs and interest rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Seth Sigman","x":"So with comps accelerating this quarter relative to prior quarters, at a time when it seems like you have raised prices, but it seems like those price increases are maybe starting to stabilize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"We are reiterating the annual guidance we provided on our Q4 call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WSM 2026 Q1","e":"wsm","d":"2026-05-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura J. Alber","x":"However, despite our beat in the first quarter, we are not raising guidance as it is early in the year and there is a lot of uncertainty in the external environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/williams-sonoma-wsm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[41,1,5348,0,0,0,1179,3733],[42,1,3544,0,0,0,784,2392],[43,1,3932,0,0,0,2794,851],[44,1,2543,0,0,0,1051,1254],[45,1,4099,0,0,0,2699,1070],[46,1,2828,0,0,0,2081,497],[47,1,3249,0,0,0,1944,904],[48,1,3996,0,0,0,3128,565],[49,1,4073,0,0,0,2525,1202],[50,1,4965,0,0,0,3525,1131],[51,1,3757,0,0,0,2435,1006],[52,1,2232,0,0,0,1603,394],[53,1,3601,0,0,0,2422,907],[55,1,2670,0,0,0,1729,681],[56,1,2849,0,0,0,1555,1042],[57,1,3647,0,0,0,2505,849],[58,1,8926,0,0,0,7320,1292],[59,1,9050,0,0,0,7530,1204],[60,1,8572,0,0,0,3211,5113],[61,1,7934,0,0,0,6731,829],[62,1,8297,0,0,0,7669,416],[64,1,9966,0,0,0,9014,650],[65,1,7992,0,0,0,6741,910],[66,1,9340,0,0,0,5678,3207]],"cinema":[[41,1,5348,0,0,0,1179,3733],[42,1,3544